				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『人は　優秀だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
